What is adapted: the portal-skill conventions and normalized record
contract — the `search`/`detail` command pair, the `--format json|table|plain`
flags, the `{ meta, results }` output shape, the `{ error, code }` stderr
convention, and the SKILL.md frontmatter layout. The CLI architecture follows
the pattern of that project's `linkedin-search` skill. The code in this
repository is independently written.

This adapter is a client of the Into Design Systems job board and its MCP
service (https://jobs.intodesignsystems.com), built and maintained by Sil
Bormüller. No part of that service is included in or distributed with this
repository; the adapter only calls it over the network.

